01:09:47.500 --> 01:09:50.360
There's this extraordinary moment during the New York Crusade.

01:09:50.950 --> 01:09:51.430
where

01:09:51.880 --> 01:09:57.260
Nixon now is vice president, comes to the crusade, and it's one of the gatherings at Yankee Stadium.

01:10:00.030 --> 01:10:03.230
