There was a meeting at the Mayflower Hotel, one of the hotels in Washington, and they came out with a statement questioning whether a Catholic should be president.

01:12:45.610 --> 01:12:55.280
When Norman Vincent Peale spoke to the press, it was widely taken as an overt manifesto of anti-Catholicism.

01:12:58.270 --> 01:12:59.970
