01:40:46.570 --> 01:40:47.770
That was part of the mood.

01:40:49.060 --> 01:40:50.060
And so we're talking.

01:40:50.920 --> 01:40:51.720
And...

01:40:52.330 --> 01:40:54.810
He said, you know, he said, I used to think

01:40:55.590 --> 01:40:55.890
that

01:40:56.170 --> 01:40:57.350
All those...

01:40:57.480 --> 01:40:58.580
Chinese babies.

01:40:59.460 --> 01:40:59.960
who never

