01:41:23.640 --> 01:41:27.040
That's just not what you say if you're an evangelist.

01:41:27.290 --> 01:41:28.790
You need this.

01:41:29.140 --> 01:41:29.960
And you need it.

01:41:30.000 --> 01:41:30.580
Today,

01:41:31.610 --> 01:41:34.330
Because tomorrow you may die and you're going to be burning in hell.

