Billy finally said,

01:41:39.370 --> 01:41:42.170
He would let God be God and let him be the judge.

01:41:44.680 --> 01:41:46.660
It's an extraordinary change.

01:41:51.180 --> 01:41:55.260
Nobody knows for sure how many conservative Christians there are in the United States.

01:41:55.530 --> 01:41:58.350
One estimate is from 30 to 65 million.

01:41:58.760 --> 01:41:59.900
These people are born again.

