01:42:29.480 --> 01:42:29.920
Number one.

01:42:30.000 --> 01:42:33.980
get people saved. Number two, get them baptized. Number three, get them registered to vote.

01:42:34.500 --> 01:42:35.480
Thank you.

01:42:35.850 --> 01:42:41.630
This year, millions of evangelical Christians appear to be coming together to form a new and powerful force.

01:42:42.150 --> 01:42:44.210
