01:42:45.350 --> 01:42:50.890
You stay home, you don't get informed, you don't get involved, you don't get active, you don't vote, you don't care.

01:42:51.210 --> 01:42:54.390
You know who runs the country? The godless, wicked forces.

01:42:54.920 --> 01:42:56.620
that are going to sell you down the river.

01:42:56.880 --> 01:42:58.460
Good Christians make good citizens.

01:42:59.370 --> 01:42:59.990
And the society.

01:43:00.000 --> 01:43:00.640
not to vote.

01:43:01.240 --> 01:43:09.680
