01:46:30.030 --> 01:46:36.320
Nixon's own dark view of how the world works, where the enemy is not just the communists, it's also the media.

01:46:46.780 --> 01:46:49.260
Listening in agreement is the Reverend Billy Graham.

01:46:49.730 --> 01:46:53.470
This stranglehold has got to be broken or this country is going to go down the drain.

01:46:54.120 --> 01:46:54.800
Yes, sir.

